<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Dear {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
We have reviewed your flight activity for the past 12 months and can see you're close to meeting the required status credits to retain your Platinum One status.<br />
<br />
As a one-time gesture of goodwill and in recognition of your continued support, we are pleased to inform you that we will extend your Platinum One status until &lt;30 July 2026&gt;. To retain beyond this date, you will need to earn <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/status-and-clubs/status.html">the required</a>&nbsp;Status Credits.<br />
<br />
Thank you for your continued support and we look forward to welcoming you on board again soon.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Kind regards,</body>
